            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87746703?u=db99c6798e39924e5bd94704b649cc50930dd631&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h2 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h2>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Removes <code class=\"notranslate\">margin: 0 auto;</code> from the <code class=\"notranslate\">.info-box</code> sample under <strong>Changes to the existing CSS</strong>.</li>\n<li>The prose already tells learners to drop centering for the fixed-position box; the code block still included it.</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #45793.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5518927712\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45793\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/45793/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45793\">#45793</a></p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Test plan</h2>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Confirm the example under <code class=\"notranslate\">### Changes to the existing CSS</code> no longer includes <code class=\"notranslate\">margin: 0 auto;</code></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Confirm the surrounding instructions still match the sample</li>\n</ul>",
